    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The arrow thumps into your lower arm, scraping the long bones as it punches through between the ulna and radius, poking out the opposite side.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (1) and @Condition[Bleeding] (1). The arm is useless for the rest of the encounter. Also, you suffer a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.GlShFJF2TpsNh1FX]{Torn Muscle (Minor)}.</p><p>Extraction will be <strong>Average (+20)</strong>.</p>"
